*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "A10AMIN.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "ShippingPrinter"
*Product: "(A10a)"
*ModelName: "A10a"
*ShortNickName: "A10a"
*NickName: "ShippingPrinter A10a"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 550"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*cupsVersion: 1.7
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertoa10a"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Letter.Fullbleed
*PageSize Letter.Fullbleed/US Letter 8.5x11 in: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4.Fullbleed/A4 210x297 mm: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Letter.Fullbleed
*PageRegion Letter.Fullbleed/US Letter 8.5x11 in: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A4.Fullbleed/A4 210x297 mm: "<</PageSize[595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Letter.Fullbleed
*ImageableArea Letter.Fullbleed/US Letter 8.5x11 in: "0 0 612 792"
*ImageableArea A4.Fullbleed/A4 210x297 mm: "0 0 595 842"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter.Fullbleed
*PaperDimension Letter.Fullbleed/US Letter 8.5x11 in: "612 792"
*PaperDimension A4.Fullbleed/A4 210x297 mm: "595 842"

*MaxMediaWidth: "612"
*MaxMediaHeight: "842"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203x203dpi
*Resolution 203x203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsRowCount 8/cupsRowFeed 0/cupsRowStep 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenGroup: PrinterSettings/Printer Settings

*OpenUI *zeMediaTracking/Media Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *zeMediaTracking
*DefaultzeMediaTracking: Stock
*zeMediaTracking Stock/Rolled Paper: ""
*zeMediaTracking Perforated/Perforated Paper: ""
*CloseUI: *zeMediaTracking

*OpenUI *Darkness/Density: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Darkness
*DefaultDarkness: 2
*Darkness Default/Default: ""
*Darkness 0: ""
*Darkness 1: ""
*Darkness 2: ""
*Darkness 3: ""
*Darkness 4: ""
*CloseUI: *Darkness

*CloseGroup: PrinterSettings

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Model: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Color: "<</cupsColorSpace 1/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsBitsPerPixel 24/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *MediaAlign/Media Align: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *MediaAlign
*DefaultMediaAlign: Center
*MediaAlign Left/Left: ""
*MediaAlign Center/Center: ""
*MediaAlign Right/Right: ""
*CloseUI: *MediaAlign

*OpenUI *FeedOffset/Paper Feeding: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 160 AnySetup *FeedOffset
*DefaultFeedOffset: 0
*FeedOffset 0/0mm: ""
*FeedOffset 1/1mm: ""
*FeedOffset 2/2mm: ""
*FeedOffset 3/3mm: ""
*FeedOffset 4/4mm: ""
*FeedOffset 5/5mm: ""
*FeedOffset 6/6mm: ""
*FeedOffset 7/7mm: ""
*FeedOffset 8/8mm: ""
*FeedOffset 9/9mm: ""
*FeedOffset 10/10mm: ""
*CloseUI: *FeedOffset
